␀Ydelse␀Drejningsmoment␀Aldersbekræftelse␀Since you have indicated that you are 13-17 years old, it is our policy to notify your parent or guardian that you have registered for the EA GAMEStm Online Service.  To continue your registration, please provide a current e-mail address for your parent or guardian who is over 18.  We will send an e-mail message to the address you provide,letting your parent or guardian know that you have registered for the EA GAMEStm Online Service.␀Forældres e-mail-adresse␀Bekræft e-mail-adresse␀Efter løbet␀Gengivelse efter løb␀Begivenhedsresultater␀Tid␀BELØNNING␀Statistik efter løb␀Omgangstid␀Position␀STILPOINT FOR LØB␀Hurtigt løb - vælg bane␀Kør ind i butik␀Nederste lag␀Mellemlag 1␀Mellemlag 2␀Øverste lag␀Fælge␀INDLÆSER␀Vælg vinylfarver␀Vælg mærkatfarver␀Hurtigt løbsmode - vælg␀Hurtigt løbsmode - indstillinger␀Pause␀Kodeord␀Spilfiltre␀Profilhåndtering␀Få nogle nye vinyler til din øse her. Du kan vælge^fra et stort bibliotek af mønstre samt frække^specialfremstillede vinyler, der kan lægges i lag^i tonsvis af kombinationer.␀Afbr. %␀Nederlag␀Sejr␀Spillede^spil␀Point␀Spillede spil␀Nederlag␀Sejre␀Sejr %␀Anklaget for serversnyd␀Anklaget for spillersnyd␀Opnået tophastighed␀Hurtigste Drag afsluttet␀Længste hop␀Længste udskridning␀Samlet pris:␀Indhold af opgradering␀KOMBINATIONSDRIFT␀BONUSZONE␀SAMMENSTØD MED VÆG␀SEJR␀SPRAYSHOW␀KOLLISION␀OMGANG I FØRING␀FEJLFRI SEKTION␀FEJLFRI OMGANG␀FEJLFRIT LØB␀GENVEJ␀UNDGIK UHELD␀Magasiner␀360␀TIDSBONUS␀BEDSTE OMGANG␀FORSPRING␀EA Messenger␀Sponsorer␀Belønninger / Sponsorer␀Måned␀Dag␀År␀Dato␀Indstillinger␀PAUSEINDSTILLINGER␀UDSKRIDNING␀SVÆVETUR␀DRAFTING␀BURNOUT␀Spil-mode␀Striber␀Sprøjt␀Moderne␀Lyn␀Flag␀Stamme␀Vild␀Sponsor␀Karrosseri␀Det er udgivet en patch til dette produkt.^For at kunne spille online, bliver du nødt til at hente og installere patchen.␀Lakeringsopsætningen for din bil er ændret.^Ønsker du at købe din nye lakeringsopsætning?␀Lakeringsopsætningen for din bil er ændret.^Ønsker du at installere din nye lakeringsopsætning?␀Ønsker du at købe denne lakeringsopsætning til din bil?␀Ønsker du at købe denne lakeringsopsætning til din bil?␀Vælg venligst en del, der skal installeres, før du afslutter!␀Tilføj denne lakering til din nuværende lakeringsopsætning?␀Ønsker du at din bil skal påføres denne lakering?␀Specialbyg bil␀␀Besøg butik /^Udfordr modstander␀Din Xbox-konsol kan ikke etablere forbindelse til Xbox Live.␀Spillertag spærret␀The Xbox Live service is very busy.  Please try again later.␀Dette spil er ikke længere tilgængeligt.␀En anden tilsluttet bruger benytter din konto.␀A required update is available for the Xbox Live service. You cannot connect to Xbox Live until the update is installed.␀Denne konto er ikke opdateret. Du må opdatere din konto i Account Recovery.␀You have an important message from Xbox Live. You must read this message before you can sign in.␀Please change your Gamertag!␀You have a new Xbox Live message. Would you like to read it now?␀Netværksforbindelsen kan påvirke dette spil.␀Afslut demo␀Afslut demoen?␀Højtemperatur␀Pulverbelægning␀Pulverbelægning␀Højtemperatur␀Nøgle til minikort␀Log på Xbox Live␀Create New Account␀␀␀␀PUBLIC SERVICE-BESKED␀␀Denne butik handler kun om udseende. Du finder nye^genstande i alle kategorier, som f.eks. hydraulik,^lydkomponenter og rotorblade, der virkelig^får din øse til at se ud af noget.␀Din bil␀Modstanders bil␀Præsentation␀Circuit␀Street X␀Bilforretning␀Lakeringsbutik␀Ydelse-butik␀Karrosseributik␀Ekstraudstyrsbutik␀Street X er tæt gadeløb på små og korte baner, hvor det gælder om at have hurtige reflekser^og nerver af stål, hvis du vil vinde. Tag^imod denne udfordring, og du vil køre et løb over 3 omgange mod 3 modstandere, hvor^du skal kæmpe hårdt for at bevare ideallinjen.␀Skift dele␀Ønsker du at gå til Ydelsestuning / Dyno-banen?␀Løbskategori: %s␀Lydstyrke for musik␀Du tabte Outrun-løbet!␀Du vandt Outrun-løbet!␀Nissan␀Mitsubishi␀Chevrolet␀Generic␀240SX␀3000GT␀350Z␀A3␀Celica␀Civic␀Corolla␀Coupe␀Default␀Eclipse␀Escalade␀Firetruck␀Focus␀G35␀Golf␀Hummer H2␀Impreza␀WRX STi␀Integra␀IS 300␀Lancer␀Lancer␀MX-5␀Mustang GT␀Navigator␀Neon␀NSX␀Peugeot␀RSX␀RX-7␀RX-8␀S2000␀Skyline␀Supra␀Coupé␀Outrun-udfordring accepteret^Ryst dem af dig!␀Outrun-udfordring accepteret^Indhent dem!␀Du er i front!␀Du har mistet føringen!␀Please enter the pass code for %s␀Street X␀Kort i udforsknings-mode␀Kort i løbs-mode␀Roterende␀Statisk␀Ønsker du at vælge denne bil?␀Vejledningstip␀Styr med␀Retningstasterne␀$JOY_EVENT_FENG_PAD_LEFT_ALTERNATE$␀Smuglyt␀␀␀Vis SMS␀Network Troubleshooter␀Xbox-betjeningspanel␀Generhvervning af konto␀Opdatér␀Læs nu␀Læs senere␀Spil alligevel␀Afslut␀Hvis du vil have en ny øse, skal du kigge forbi bilforretningen.␀␀␀␀␀Fejl under tilslutning til Xbox Live␀Xbox Live - Information␀%d ulæste beskeder␀Besked %d ud af %d␀Rachel␀Rachel␀Rachel␀Rachel␀Rachel␀Rachel␀Rachel␀Rachel␀Rachel␀Rachel␀Messaging System␀Changing Controls␀Map Legend␀Outrun Mode␀Rules for Outrun Mode␀Hidden Shops␀The Race Breaker␀Magazine Photo Shoot␀Taking a Picture␀Magazine Cover Shot␀To enter shops or events, drive into the animated zone and press up on^the directional button when prompted by your SMS messaging system.^To read incoming messages press right on the directional button when^the mail icon appears.␀To change the steering controls, select Options and then select Player from the Pause Menu. Here you can cycle through the various steering preferences.␀Press down on the directional button to access the mini map legend.^This will show you what each icon on your map represents.␀Keep an eye out for other tuner cars on the road. They will be marked on your Mini-map as orange triangles. You can challenge these cars to an "Outrun" race by pressing up on the SMS HUD when prompted. When racing, the object is to gain the lead from your opponent and then lose them! You are free to take any route you want to try and beat them.␀The objective of an outrun race is to gain the lead and lose the opponent by creating a distance of over 300 meters.  You are free to^take any route you want when you are the leader.  If you are behind,^you need to catch the leader and pass them to take control of the race.␀Be sure to visit all the tuner shops in the world.  Most are marked on the mini map but "underground" race shop locations are tucked away "off the beaten path".  Keep a look out for side roads and alleys that can lead to special shops that carry the best parts and upgrades.␀The Race Breaker is a new addition to your nitrous system.  When you^fill your nitrous past 100%, you start collecting Race Breaker nitrous.^This adds even more boost and grip to your car and can make the^difference in a race.  Regular nitrous is identified by the blue color on^your nitrous HUD.  When it fills up, the green Race Breaker nitrous will^begin filling up on top of your regular nitrous.␀That was some nice driving!  There's a photographer who wants to get a shot of the winning car for Underground magazine.  You've got 45^seconds to reach his location before he takes off to find another driver.^The location is marked by a flashing yellow star on your mini map, now hurry!␀Congratulations!^Your car will be featured on the cover of the Need for Speed^Underground 2 magazine!␀That's a sweet ride you just picked up!  There's a photographer who^wants to snap a picture of your car for a tuner magazine cover.  His^location is marked with a yellow star on your mini map.␀Fra: %s␀Emne: %s␀Welcome to Need for Speed Underground 2.^This demo lets you experience a small part of the high speed,^fast paced world of tuner culture available in the full version.^^^^^Coming November 2004␀Ønsker du at vælge dette karrosseri?␀LYD␀SPILLER␀GAMEPLAY␀DEBUG␀DEBUG Rendering␀DEBUG Physics␀␀Diskvalificeret␀venter␀modtaget␀Opløsning␀Detaljegrad␀Skift grafikindstillinger␀Standardindstillinger␀Lav␀Mellem␀Høj␀Grafik␀Are you sure you want to exit to the Xbox Dashboard and create a new Xbox Live  Account?␀Februar␀Marts␀April ␀Maj␀Juni␀Juli␀August ␀September ␀Oktober␀November ␀December ␀␀Alle␀Spillerliste␀Anmodning om ven␀Blokeret␀Ekstraudstyrsbutik␀Spiltype␀Rangeret␀Ikke rangeret␀Begynd løb␀Primært␀Sekundært␀© 2004 Electronic Arts Inc. Alle rettigheder forbeholdes.␀Vælg␀Benytter onlinepersona %s ...␀Vælg bil␀Nedtælling til løb: %d␀Omg.␀Indkommende SMS-besked␀Free-Roaming City␀Performance Tuning␀New Gameplay Modes␀Visual Customization␀Compete Online␀Races can happen anytime, anywhere␀Fine-tune every aspect of your car␀Hone your skills in a number of driving disciplines␀New personalization options and tons of new parts␀Challenging the world␀Each car lot will have a different inventory, so you might have to do some exploring to find the model you want. There are over 30 models from some of the best known manufacturers on the tuning scene, including Nissan, Mazda, Toyota, Subaru, Mitsubishi, Ford, and more.␀Here are 2 examples of some tricked out rides that you can build^in the full version of Underground 2.␀Each car lot will have a different inventory, so you might have to do^some exploring to find the model you want. There are over 30^models from some of the best known manufacturers on the^tuning scene, including Nissan, Mazda, Toyota,^Subaru, Mitsubishi, Ford, and more.^^Here are 2 examples of some tricked out rides^that you can build in the full version of Underground 2.␀In the full version of Underground 2, the paint shop is the place^to go to add that personal touch to your ride. Make your car^stand out from the crowd with a special paint or cool custom^vinyl. You can also come here to apply your favorite^manufacturer decal to your car.^^Here is a small sample of colors and paint styles that you^can apply to your car.␀␀Nuværende bil␀Tunerbil 1␀Tunerbil 2␀Gendan standardindstillinger?␀Opdateringshastighed for bilrefleksion␀Detaljer for bilrefleksion␀Bilskygger␀Bilforlygter␀Bilbelysning␀Tilskuere␀Detaljer i spilverden␀Detaljer for vejrefleksion␀meter␀Tid:␀Grønskolling␀Nybegynder␀Trænet␀Rutineret␀Avanc